#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0148 expect=violation domain=ADMD
#note "No structure key. PARAMCD makes it BASIC DATA STRUCTURE and SPDEVID refines it to MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, whose structure set is [MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, BASIC DATA STRUCTURE]; ScopeMatcher matches on any token, so it satisfies this rule's single-token Include [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] through the Fix #179 is-a relation. Fractional PARAMN fires."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 PARAMN=2.5
dataset ADMD
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col PARAMN  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV-01 | SYSBP | 2.5
